# Datasets: raw CSVs are not committed. data/train.zip is committed only if the dataset
# licence allows redistribution - remove the exception below otherwise.
data/*.csv
data/*.parquet
!data/train.zip

# Large model artifacts: the current artifacts are < 1 MB and ARE committed so the app runs
# on Streamlit Community Cloud. If you retrain much larger models, uncomment these lines and
# see "Large model files" in the README.
# models/*.joblib
